  {
   "text": "Lena Okafor now has exactly one Patient record, and I created it. The Patient list was empty when I started, so there was no existing record to report.\n\nMy first save went wrong. The JSON tab on the new-patient screen doesn't carry its contents into the Create button, so Create saved a blank Patient. I then filled in that same record through the Edit form instead of creating a second one. Its history now has the blank first version plus the edits that filled it in.\n\nThe saved record has:\n- **Name:** Lena Okafor\n- **Date of birth:** 1988-04-22\n- **Sex:** female\n- **Address:** 14 Birch Lane, Springfield, MA 01103\n- **Telecom:** home phone 413-555-0187 and email lena.okafor@example.org\n\nNothing else was written. The Patient list afterwards shows only this one record.\n\nRESULT: DONE Patient/72ee41e4-8c99-453b-9fed-5e1d7ce5b750",
